{"id":"666257bc1bd5bf10","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-implorder.md","title":"Partial-specification order","display":"df-implorder — Partial-specification order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-implorder","aliases":["27-df-implorder"],"display":"df-implorder — Partial-specification order","depends_on":["[[27-df-compat]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-implorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-implorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implorder — Partial-specification order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5cf2cdaf54dc651b\" href=\"?note=5cf2cdaf54dc651b\" title=\"27-df-compat\">27-df-compat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i,F_i\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T_i,F_i\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}(T_i,F_i)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}(T_i,F_i)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>）；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5cf2cdaf54dc651b\" href=\"?note=5cf2cdaf54dc651b\" title=\"27-df-compat\">27-df-compat</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T_1,F_1)\\sqsubseteq(T_2,F_2)\\leftrightarrow T_1\\subseteq T_2\\land F_1\\subseteq F_2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T_1,F_1)\\sqsubseteq(T_2,F_2)\\leftrightarrow T_1\\subseteq T_2\\land F_1\\subseteq F_2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>More information means fewer extensions: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T_1,F_1)\\sqsubseteq(T_2,F_2)\">\\((T_1,F_1)\\sqsubseteq(T_2,F_2)\\)</span> implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}(T_2,F_2)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ext}(T_1,F_1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}(T_2,F_2)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ext}(T_1,F_1)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-compat","status":"resolved","id":"5cf2cdaf54dc651b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-compat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-compat","status":"resolved","id":"5cf2cdaf54dc651b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T_i,F_i\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$ 且 $\\mathrm{Compatible}(T_i,F_i)$（$i\\in\\{1,2\\}$）；见 [[27-df-compat]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ext}$ (see [[27-df-extension]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T_i,F_i\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}(T_i,F_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"(T_1,F_1)\\sqsubseteq(T_2,F_2)\\leftrightarrow T_1\\subseteq T_2\\land F_1\\subseteq F_2","display":true},{"tex":"(T_1,F_1)\\sqsubseteq(T_2,F_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}(T_2,F_2)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ext}(T_1,F_1)","display":false}],"bytes":845,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-implorder|df-implorder — Partial-specification order]]"}],"outgoing":["5cf2cdaf54dc651b","2080bf803b294b75"]}